{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">荃灣象鼻山路昨日（5日）發生一宗驚險交通意外，一輛貨車駛入荃錦交匯處時突告失控，先撞向一輛私家車，再失平衡撞向石壆當場翻側。事件中，67歲的貨車男司機報稱肩膀及手臂疼痛，由救護車送往仁濟醫院接受治理，而43歲的私家車女司機則無大礙，毋須送院。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-06-10h45m53s961.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20261SOZmqmueU1791255045.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-06-10h45m53s961.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">事後網上有片段還原事發驚險一幕。片中所見，私家車當時正順著迴旋處外圈行駛，而貨車從象鼻山路駛入時，幾乎攔腰直撞私家車，貨車司機急急扭軚避讓，惟車輛失控擦撞私家車後，隨即失去平衡重重撞石壆翻側。萬幸的是，私家車在碰撞後及時駛離，未有被翻側的貨車正中壓下，化解一場巨大危機。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-06-10h45m55s249.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026994fWYcmQr1791255052.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-06-10h45m55s249.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">影片曝光後，不少網民直指畫面可怕，紛紛表示：「真係要還神！」、「好彩冇壓到」、「慢多一秒就大鑊！」</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-06-10h45m56s495.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026N1GVZ3PWVc1791255059.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-06-10h45m56s495.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-06T03:20:06.020701+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":307,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}